  "decision_summary": "The most similar and directly condition-matched evidence supports meaningful CNS access: human CSF sampling showed rapid brain entry, and additional rodent and primate systemic-dosing studies confirmed BBB passage. Some lower-similarity analogs failed to penetrate the brain, but the overall direct experimental record favors a pass.",
